      "id": 15727,
      "name": "pyrowolfs",
      "username": "pyrowolfs",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/5e9695/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-09-29T01:05:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I just got my 5th anniversary holo box in the mail and had some questions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What are these redeemed villian cards? At least that's what I assume they are, most (all?) look like a villian but are heroes, they all also share the same hero symbol so how does that work?</p><p>On Super Sentai Idealist her power targets a concept? as far as I know i've never seen that keyword untill this card. in the same vain one of the wraith cards mentions taking \"shadow cloak\" from the deck or trash, which I don't remember that card. apologies if that is just a normal card in the sentinels deck.</p><p>Lastly to anyone else who picked this up: How was the overall quality? For the most part mine was great up untill the end. The last 11 cards had some problems, 10 of them had minor defects (this line on the top of the card that was a raised bump) then the very last card in the pack Completionist Guise had a bit worse defects had the line on top as well as some bending/squiggly pattern on the right side.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Overall really great, love seeing all the holo cards and all the varients I didn't have. Sentinels has been my favorite game to play with friends for the last 5 years and I'm sad it's only got the one expansion left.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:48:12.983Z",
