      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-09-29T04:38:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Several people have reported marks on their Completionist Guises.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>As for the heroes you didn't recognise, there are 11 new heroes arriving with OblivAeon. &nbsp;The 5 heroes in the set (Luminary, The Harpy, Akash'Thriya, La Capitan, and Lifeline) as long as the two mini expansion heroes (Stuntman and Benchmark) are all villains who have joined the heroes to fight OblivAeon, while the remaining 4 are The Void Guard - the Southwest Sentinels got an upgrade and now each have their own deck.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Several of the new heroes reference keywords that we have not seen yet.</p>",
